    "A 24-hour time with am or pm: RYFT used the 24-hour time" : {
      "comment" : "Import warning, after \"Line N\", e.g. for 16:41 pm.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine 24-Stunden-Zeit mit am oder pm: RYFT nimmt die 24-Stunden-Zeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few minutes now saves a silent week of missing data." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the setup screen after Apple Health access.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein paar Minuten jetzt ersparen dir eine Woche ohne Daten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification %lld min before tonight's bedtime. It moves with your day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
