    "Yesterday's readiness, until last night is scored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Bereitschaft von gestern, bis die letzte Nacht bewertet ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can add a tracker any time. RYFT will show how to connect it." : {
      "comment" : "Just my iPhone card.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst jederzeit ein Gerät hinzufügen. RYFT zeigt dir, wie du es verbindest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can leave the app — RYFT keeps going in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst die App verlassen – RYFT macht im Hintergrund weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can sign in to this account with:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei diesem Konto kannst du dich anmelden mit:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're signed out, so this report can't be sent. Your message is kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist abgemeldet, deshalb kann diese Meldung nicht gesendet werden. Deine Nachricht bleibt erhalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've reached today's limit of 10 reports. Your message is kept; try again tomorrow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast das Tageslimit von 10 Meldungen erreicht. Deine Nachricht bleibt erhalten, versuch es morgen noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're signed out · Details" : {
      "comment" : "Today's status line while the signed-out card is shown (last on Today); tapping scrolls to the card.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist abgemeldet · Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're signed out, so new data can't load." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist abgemeldet, deshalb können keine neuen Daten geladen werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your baseline is yours to set. The top-ups follow yesterday's strain and your sleep debt; a nap lowers the next night's need." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deinen Grundbedarf legst du fest. Die Zuschläge folgen der Belastung von gestern und deinem Schlafdefizit; ein Nickerchen senkt den Bedarf der nächsten Nacht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll get" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bekommst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your baselines are being recalculated." : {
      "comment" : "Today's sentence in row D when today's readiness is shown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Ausgangswerte werden neu berechnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your baselines are still forming." : {
      "comment" : "Today's sentence while the baselines fill (row B).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Ausgangswerte entstehen noch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your birth year gives an estimate of your maximum heart rate, which strain and heart-rate zones are measured against. RYFT keeps only the year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus deinem Geburtsjahr schätzt RYFT deine maximale Herzfrequenz, an der Belastung und Herzfrequenzzonen gemessen werden. RYFT speichert nur das Jahr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your choices below are kept for when you turn notifications back on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Auswahl unten bleibt erhalten, bis du Mitteilungen wieder einschaltest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is safe. RYFT will keep trying." : {
      "comment" : "Pending gauge line when scoring takes longer than usual.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Daten sind sicher. RYFT versucht es weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your health data, your consent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Gesundheitsdaten, deine Einwilligung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your history is on its way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Verlauf ist unterwegs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night hasn't reached Apple Health yet." : {
      "comment" : "Today's morning hint when the quiet source isn't a known tracker.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Nacht ist noch nicht in Apple Health angekommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night hasn't reached Apple Health yet. Keep your Apple Watch near your iPhone so it syncs." : {
      "comment" : "Today's morning hint when the quiet source is an Apple Watch. German: a soft hyphen in “synchronisieren” keeps the full stop off a line of its own at accessibility sizes.",
      "localizations" : {
