          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Nacht ist noch nicht in Apple Health angekommen. Halte deine Apple Watch in der Nähe deines iPhones, damit sie synchroni­siert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night hasn't reached Apple Health yet. Open %@ to sync it." : {
      "comment" : "Today's morning hint: the tracker's app (e.g. Garmin Connect) hasn't sent last night to Apple Health yet. German: a soft hyphen in “synchronisieren” keeps the full stop off a line of its own at accessibility sizes.",
